Upstream-Name: omacam
Upstream-Contact: Derek Ross <https://github.com/derekross>
Source: https://github.com/derekross/omacam
Comment: The upstream source comes as a fixed commit from GitHub (git archive);
 the Rust crates named in its Cargo.lock come from crates.io unchanged, as the
 orig-vendor component (vendor/). The binary links the crates statically: the
 license field and license files of each crate are in
 /usr/share/doc/omacam/crate-licenses.txt.gz.

